     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ehealth-situation-quality</b></p><a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality\"> </a><a name=\"hcehealth-situation-quality\"> </a><p><b>Properties</b></p><p><b>This code system defines the following properties for its concepts</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Code</b></td><td><b>URI</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td>Deprecated</td><td>deprecated</td><td>http://hl7.org/fhir/concept-properties#deprecated</td><td>dateTime</td><td>Indicates that the concept is deprecated and should not be used</td></tr></table><p><b>Concepts</b></p><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://ehealth.sundhed.dk/cs/situation-quality</code> defines the following codes in a Is-A hierarchy:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td><b>Lvl</b></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td><td><b>Deprecated</b></td><td><b>Dansk (Danish, da)</b></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">none<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-none\"> </a></td><td>No quality needed</td><td>Quality value where no derivation rule logic nor values are expected</td><td/><td>Ingen situationskvalitet krævet/ventet</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  unknown<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-unknown\"> </a></td><td>Unknown quality</td><td>Unknown quality (Unlikely to be adequate if a quality value is expected)</td><td/><td>Ukendt situationskvalitet</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">    derivation-error<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-derivation-error\"> </a></td><td>Error in deriving or determining the quality</td><td>Quality value could not be derived due to insufficient input, unknown/unavailable logic, or other error</td><td/><td>Situationskvaliteten kunne ikke bestemmes grundet manglende input, utilgængelig logik, eller anden fejl.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">      normal<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-normal\"> </a></td><td>Normal/neutral situation quality</td><td>Normal/neutral situation quality</td><td/><td>Normalt/neutralt situationskvalitetsniveau</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">        finger-not-cold<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-finger-not-cold\"> </a></td><td>Finger is not cold</td><td>Finger is not cold</td><td/><td>Finger ej kold</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">        supported-by-armrest<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-supported-by-armrest\"> </a></td><td>Performed with armrest support</td><td>Performed with armrest support</td><td/><td>Udført med støtte fra armlæn</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">        arms-crossed<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-arms-crossed\"> </a></td><td>Performed with arms crossed</td><td>Performed with arms crossed</td><td/><td>udført med korslagte arme</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">        lying-down<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-lying-down\"> </a></td><td>Performed lying down</td><td>Performed lying down</td><td/><td>Udført liggende</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">        sitting<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-sitting\"> </a></td><td>Performed sitting</td><td>Performed sitting</td><td/><td>Udført siddende</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Unknown<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-Unknown\"> </a></td><td>Unknown quality</td><td>Unknown quality (Unlikely to be adequate if a quality value is expected)</td><td>2020-02-03</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  None<a name=\"ehealth-situation-quality-None\"> </a></td><td>No quality needed</td><td>Quality value where no derivation rule logic nor values are expected</td><td>2020-02-03</td><td/></tr><tr><td>3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">    DerivationError<a name=\"ehealth-situa